  "source": "message/dat/Spanish/script/sdc01_0070.dat",
  "paired_tbl": "message/dat/Spanish/script/sdc01_0070.tbl",
  "matching": "TRAILING_MAX_SENTINEL",
  "entries": [
    {
      "ordinal": 0,
      "label": "sdc01_0070_caretaker_01",
      "hash64": "80DA18B6BFF93169",
      "text": "¡Adelante, adelante![VAR 0x0114(0045)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 20,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0045"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "sdc01_0070_caretaker_02",
      "hash64": "80DA15B6BFF92C50",
      "text": "No os preocupéis por quitaros los zapatos.\\c\\nBueno, si están muy sucios, hacedme el favor de\\nlimpiarlos con la manguera de la entrada, ¿vale?[VAR 0x0114(0045)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 42,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 142,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0045"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "sdc01_0070_caretaker_03",
      "hash64": "80DA16B6BFF92E03",
      "text": "¿Qué os parece? ¿A que está reluciente?\\nEstá recién construido.\\c\\n¡No tiene nada que envidiarles a los edificios\\nesos tan modernos de las grandes ciudades![VAR 0x0114(0045)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 63,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 156,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0045"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "sdc01_0070_caretaker_04",
      "hash64": "80DA1BB6BFF93682",
      "text": "Esta es la zona común para descansar y socializar.\\c\\nEstá equipada con una tele y podéis usarla como\\nbien os plazca.[VAR 0x0114(0045)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 50,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 117,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0045"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "sdc01_0070_caretaker_05",
      "hash64": "80DA1CB6BFF93835",
      "text": "¿Qué más? Ah, sí... El comedor está por allá,\\ny los baños están por allí...[VAR 0x0114(0045)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 75,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0045"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "sdc01_0070_caretaker_06",
      "hash64": "80DA19B6BFF9331C",
      "text": "Vuestras habitaciones están al final del pasillo.\\nPodéis ir a tumbaros siempre que os entre sueño.[VAR 0x0114(0045)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 98,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0045"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "sdc01_0070_caretaker_07",
      "hash64": "80DA1AB6BFF934CF",
      "text": "Tenemos de sobra, ¡así que no hace falta que\\ncompartáis![VAR 0x0114(0045)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 56,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0045"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "sdc01_0070_caretaker_08",
      "hash64": "80DA1FB6BFF93D4E",
      "text": "Y creo que con eso concluye la visita guiada,\\nsi no se me olvida nada...[VAR 0x0114(0045)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 72,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0045"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "sdc01_0070_caretaker_09",
      "hash64": "80DA20B6BFF93F01",
      "text": "Para cualquier cosita que os surja, esta señorita\\ntan maja estará en recepción para ayudaros.[VAR 0x0114(0045)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 93,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0045"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "sdc01_0070_bbteacher_01",
      "hash64": "FFFDC851C0E18FAF",
      "text": "¡Perfecto! Nos lo ha dejado todo clarísimo.[VAR 0x0114(0042)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 43,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0042"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "sdc01_0070_bbteacher_02",
      "hash64": "FFFDC951C0E19162",
      "text": "¡Mirad lo bien que nos han recibido, grupo!\\n¿Qué se dice en momentos como este?[VAR 0x0114(0042)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 79,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0042"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "sdc01_0070_select_01",
      "hash64": "CC80CF2E01435893",
      "text": "¡Nos hace mucha ilusión estar aquí!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "sdc01_0070_select_02",
      "hash64": "CC80D02E01435A46",
      "text": "¡Gracias por todo!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "sdc01_0070_all_01",
      "hash64": "C7D65FF5EF2D2204",
      "text": "¡Sí, qué ilusión!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "sdc01_0070_all_02",
      "hash64": "C7D662F5EF2D271D",
      "text": "¡Gracias por todooo!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "sdc01_0070_caretaker_10",
      "hash64": "80DD1DB6BFFB6FBF",
      "text": "¡Pero qué jovencitos tan majos nos han tocado!\\nY yo que me alegro de daros la bienvenida.[VAR 0x0114(0045)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 89,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0045"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "label": "sdc01_0070_caretaker_11",
      "hash64": "80DD1CB6BFFB6E0C",
      "text": "Pues nada, ¡a relajarse y como si estuvieseis\\nen vuestra casa![VAR 0x0114(0045)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 62,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0045"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "label": "sdc01_0070_bbteacher_03",
      "hash64": "FFFDCA51C0E19315",
      "text": "Ha sido un viaje muy largo. Debéis de estar\\ntodos agotados, ¿no?[VAR 0x0114(0042)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 64,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0042"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "label": "sdc01_0070_bbteacher_04",
      "hash64": "FFFDC351C0E18730",
      "text": "Es algo temprano, pero lo mejor será que\\ncenemos y nos vayamos pronto a la cama.[VAR 0x0114(0042)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 80,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0042"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "label": "sdc01_0070_caretaker_12",
      "hash64": "80DD1FB6BFFB7325",
      "text": "¡La cena ya está servida! Es bastante generosa,\\nasí que espero que vengáis todos con apetito.[VAR 0x0114(0045)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 93,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0045"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 20,
      "label": "sdc01_0070_students_01",
      "hash64": "0CD6A086E2AE6EE3",
      "text": "¡Qué hambre!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 21,
      "label": "sdc01_0070_students_02",
      "hash64": "0CD6A186E2AE7096",
      "text": "¡Qué bueno estaba todo!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 22,
      "label": "sdc01_0070_bbteacher_05",
      "hash64": "FFFDC451C0E188E3",
      "text": "Pues nada, eres libre de hacer lo que te apetezca\\nahora.\\c\\nPero recuerda que mañana empezamos con las\\nactividades del campamento.[VAR 0x0114(0042)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 56,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 130,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0042"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 23,
      "label": "sdc01_0070_bbteacher_06",
      "hash64": "FFFDC551C0E18A96",
      "text": "¡No te acuestes muy tarde, que habrá que\\nmadrugar![VAR 0x0114(0042)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 50,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0042"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 24,
      "label": "sdc01_0070_caretaker_13",
      "hash64": "80DD1EB6BFFB7172",
      "text": "¿Qué, te ha gustado la comida de Noroteo?[VAR 0x0114(0045)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 41,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0045"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 25,
      "label": "sdc01_0070_bbteacher_07",
      "hash64": "FFFDC651C0E18C49",
      "text": "Si no hay ningún contratiempo, los alumnos de la\\nAcademia Arándano se unirán a nosotros a partir\\r\\nde mañana. Espero que os llevéis todos bien.[VAR 0x0114(0042)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 96,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 144,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0042"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 26,
      "label": "sdc01_0070_student1_01",
      "hash64": "8DEE76AA6CF16941",
      "text": "¡Qué ganas tengo de ver qué haremos durante\\nel campamento!\\c\\nCreo que me va a costar dormir de los nervios...",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 58,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 27,
      "label": "sdc01_0070_student2_01",
      "hash64": "89773693999F984E",
      "text": "La comida de Noroteo parece muy sana,\\n¡y aun así está todo riquísimo!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 28,
      "label": "sdc01_0070_student3_01",
      "hash64": "B6C42299FC1E3DA3",
      "text": "Puaj... Acabo de ver un Pokémon insecto en mi\\nhabitación...",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 29,
      "label": "sdc01_0070_stopper_01",
      "hash64": "D98AD6A61E5432B0",
